{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:c676da80fcf0e52c","name":"Vo'ren's Second Cadence","source":{"id":"source:reference-c676da80fcf0e52c","title":"Vo'ren's Second Cadence","revision":20571,"timestamp":"2024-08-26T00:06:27Z","sha256":"43920f64fd267bf394c3a6b8eda44dc5b320c104fe25b67d8c89175cc9f88b49","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=20571","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Vo%27ren%27s%20Second%20Cadence&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-c676da80fcf0e52c","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Jedi Academy Training Manual"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jedi_Academy_Training_Manual"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Vo'ren's Second Cadence"]}," teaches not only control, but also spacial awareness. You must set up 72 wax cylinders at 5-degree intervals around your body, each one approximately 1.5 meters away. Atop each cylinder, one metal ball bearing is placed. Like ",{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Vo'ren's First Cadence"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vo%27ren%27s_First_Cadence","referenceId":"reference:66f5c9ccbd494a55"}]},", you must place the cylinders and ball bearings one at a time until all 72 have been placed. However, unlike the ",{"tag":"i","children":["First Cadence"]},", you must strike at all of the cylinders in a full 360-degree arc without turning your body to face the cylinders to the rear, honing your ability to strike at enemies coming from all sides.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Time:"]}," 2 Hours\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Targets:"]}," Self\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Requirements:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsaber"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsaber","referenceId":"reference:987a817de9003439"},", 72 wax cylinders, and 2,701 ball bearings.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Make a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use the Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_the_Force","referenceId":"reference:74883d1dd46b87fe"}," check."]}," You take a penalty on your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use the Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_the_Force","referenceId":"reference:74883d1dd46b87fe"}," check equal to your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dark Side Score"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dark_Side_Score"},". The result of the check determines the benefits of the regimen:\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"table","children":["\n",{"tag":"tbody","children":[{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"th","children":["DC\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["EFFECT\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":["18\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["You damage two cylinders. You gain a +1 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force"}," bonus on ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsaber"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsaber","referenceId":"reference:987a817de9003439"}," attack rolls against creatures that ",{"tag":"a","children":["Flank"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Flank"}," you.\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":["23\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["You damage one cylinder. You gain a +2 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force"}," bonus on ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsaber"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsaber","referenceId":"reference:987a817de9003439"}," attack rolls against creatures that ",{"tag":"a","children":["Flank"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Flank"}," you.\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":["28\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["You complete the cadence without damaging any cylinders. You gain a +2 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force"}," bonus on ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsaber"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsaber","referenceId":"reference:987a817de9003439"}," attack rolls against creatures that ",{"tag":"a","children":["Flank"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Flank"}," you, and you gain the benefits of the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Whirlwind Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Whirlwind_Attack","referenceId":"reference:42e4a091048fa93e"}," feat (if you do not already know it).\n"]}]}]}]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
